contracts/interfaces/AggregatorV3Interface.sol reproduces the Chainlink data-feed
interface (MIT) so that MintBound can serve and consume it without taking a package
dependency. contracts/creditcoin/examples/SecureMintReference.sol is an independent
implementation of the publicly documented Chainlink "Secure Mint" pattern, written to
that specification as evidence of drop-in compatibility. Both files carry attribution
in their headers. Chainlink is a trademark of its respective owner; this project is
not affiliated with, endorsed by, or a product of Chainlink Labs.
